{
  "id": "ending__蹈海",
  "type": "ending",
  "displayName": "蹈海",
  "blueprint": {
    "startNodeId": "start",
    "nodes": {
      "start": {
        "id": "start",
        "type": "flowStart",
        "inputs": {},
        "x": 40,
        "y": 40
      },
      "cg_001": {
        "id": "cg_001",
        "type": "emitEvent",
        "inputs": {
          "eventName": "content:showCg",
          "payload": {
            "cgId": "cg_ewexmk_5"
          }
        },
        "x": 340,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_002": {
        "id": "line_002",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "鱼群。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_002:continue"
        },
        "x": 640,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_003": {
        "id": "line_003",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "汹涌不断浪潮翻滚无边无际的海洋，与其中的，同样无边无际的鱼群。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_003:continue"
        },
        "x": 940,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_004": {
        "id": "line_004",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "那些微小的，非人的，异质的脊椎动物与无脊椎动物，从来就是那高居于食物链顶端的存在——人类的盘中美馔。当然也是他们动物朋友与其他生物界同伴的食粮。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_004:continue"
        },
        "x": 1240,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_005": {
        "id": "line_005",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "但让我们回到人类——对人类而言，它们从来就是不值得同情的，如果给予它们哪怕最微末的同情的话，那宇宙的精华、万物的灵长就会失去一切自诩的圣性，而泯然于众造物。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_005:continue"
        },
        "x": 1540,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_006": {
        "id": "line_006",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "所以不妨假设，假设这种在上古者之眼的注视下年轻胜过新星的所谓“传统”，是天经地义，是自然规律。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_006:continue"
        },
        "x": 1840,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_007": {
        "id": "line_007",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "哦，你要知道，鱼虾是有大脑的。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_007:continue"
        },
        "x": 2140,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_008": {
        "id": "line_008",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "信不信由你——它们会感到痛觉。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_008:continue"
        },
        "x": 2440,
        "y": 40
      },
      "cg_009": {
        "id": "cg_009",
        "type": "emitEvent",
        "inputs": {
          "eventName": "content:showCg",
          "payload": {
            "cgId": "cg_ewexmk_6"
          }
        },
        "x": 2740,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_010": {
        "id": "line_010",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "从盲目痴愚的阿撒托斯说起（从那个无可名状的创世之梦开始，宇宙将永远冷漠，直到诡异的万古）——一直到原始浓汤里诞生的巨神乌波·萨斯拉——再到那臃肿的札特瓜的怪形，和无名的巨蟹神，就是那称为世界之癌的——日光之下并无新事：",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_010:continue"
        },
        "x": 3040,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_011": {
        "id": "line_011",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "万物终将受苦——这恰好促成了某种复制单位在时空中的扩散。或者反过来说也一样，这是个循环。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_011:continue"
        },
        "x": 3340,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_012": {
        "id": "line_012",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "Ia! 旧日支配者昔在，今在，永在！但阿尔-哈兹莱德又曾说过，在诡异的万古中就连死亡也会消逝。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_012:continue"
        },
        "x": 3640,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_013": {
        "id": "line_013",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "……",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_013:continue"
        },
        "x": 3940,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_014": {
        "id": "line_014",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "祸哉！我灭亡了。因为它们已来复仇。它们来报复我——它们的食客。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_014:continue"
        },
        "x": 4240,
        "y": 40
      },
      "cg_015": {
        "id": "cg_015",
        "type": "emitEvent",
        "inputs": {
          "eventName": "content:showCg",
          "payload": {
            "cgId": "cg_ewexmk_4"
          }
        },
        "x": 4540,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_016": {
        "id": "line_016",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "接受这一切吧。温和顺从地走进这片鱼群，正如鱼群游进罗网，万物的灵长达观地走进坟墓。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_016:continue"
        },
        "x": 4840,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_017": {
        "id": "line_017",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "别无他选。只能接受。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_017:continue"
        },
        "x": 5140,
        "y": 40
      },
      "end": {
        "id": "end",
